<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2008371473"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1660792787"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="ハレロ (紅組)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="22/7"/><amll:meta key="album" value="神様だって決められない (Special Edition)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:02.013"><div begin="00:16.348" end="03:34.998"><p begin="00:16.348" end="00:20.696" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">雨は降り続いてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雨还在下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a me ha fu ri tsu du i te ru</span></p><p begin="00:21.922" end="00:28.101" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">何も語ることもないまま…<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉默着一言不发</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n ni mo ka ta ru ko to mo na i ma ma</span></p><p begin="00:30.169" end="00:31.815" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">大地に吸い込まれた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被大地吸收的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i chi ni su i ko ma re ta</span></p><p begin="00:32.268" end="00:33.642" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">幾億の雨粒たち<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">数亿颗雨滴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ku o ku no a ma tsu bu ta chi</span></p><p begin="00:34.213" end="00:38.162" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">言葉を持つことのない感情<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法用语言表达的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba wo mo tsu ko to no na i ka n jo u</span></p><p begin="00:38.850" end="00:43.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">地球の奥に消えてしまえよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">消失在地球深处吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi kyu u no o ku ni ki e te shi ma e yo</span></p><p begin="00:45.553" end="00:47.703" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">悲しみはキリない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悲伤永无止境</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na shi mi ha ki ri na i</span></p><p begin="00:48.362" end="00:53.161" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">何度でも空に昇り雲になる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">许多次升上天空化作云</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n do de mo so ra ni no bo ri ku mo ni na ru</span></p><p begin="00:53.809" end="00:56.887" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">あともう少し 頑張ったら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果再努力一点的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a to mo u su ko shi ga n ba 't ta ra</span></p><p begin="00:57.571" end="01:01.235" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">太陽が君を照らしてくれる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">太阳就能照耀着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta i yo u ga ki mi wo te ra shi te ku re ru</span></p><p begin="01:03.076" end="01:03.976" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">「ハレロ」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“放晴吧”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ha re ro 」</span></p><p begin="01:04.390" end="01:08.842" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">風が吹き始めて 世界は回り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">风开始吹拂 世界在旋转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ga fu ki ha ji me te se ka i ha ma wa ri</span></p><p begin="01:09.456" end="01:11.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">空の色も変わる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天空的颜色也改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra no i ro mo ka wa ru</span></p><p begin="01:12.294" end="01:17.461" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">晴天とは なんて美しいんだ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">晴天为何会如此美丽？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se i te n to ha na n te u tsu ku shi i n da ?</span></p><p begin="01:19.151" end="01:23.619" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">時間が過ぎた後は 涙も乾き<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时间流逝后 眼泪也干涸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ki ga su gi ta a to ha na mi da mo ka wa ki</span></p><p begin="01:24.354" end="01:26.551" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">何も残らない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">什么都未曾留下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni mo no ko ra na i</span></p><p begin="01:27.173" end="01:34.446" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">身も心も 晴れ晴れしている未来<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">未来 身心同样晴空万里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi mo ko ko ro mo ha re ba re shi te i ru mi ra i</span></p><p begin="01:42.682" end="01:47.049" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">緑の木々を揺らし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">苍翠的树木随风摇晃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi do ri no ki gi wo yu ra shi</span></p><p begin="01:48.429" end="01:52.846" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">ざわめく 鳥たちの声は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">鸟儿们吵闹的鸣叫</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">za wa me ku to ri ta chi no ko e ha</span></p><p begin="01:53.069" end="01:55.489" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">届いているのか？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否听见?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to do i te i ru no ka ?</span></p><p begin="01:57.251" end="01:59.639" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">時間なら無限だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时间是无限的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji ka n na ra mu ge n da</span></p><p begin="02:00.251" end="02:05.218" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">永遠を何周もできるのさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可以体会无数次永远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e i e n wo na n shu u mo de ki ru no sa</span></p><p begin="02:05.928" end="02:08.895" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">ぬかるんでいる今の気持ちも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在泥泞不堪的心情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">nu ka ru n de ru i ma no ki mo chi mo</span></p><p begin="02:09.586" end="02:14.719" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">いつの日かきっと忘れられるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将来某天一定能够忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu no hi ka ki 't to wa su re ra re ru yo</span></p><p begin="02:15.305" end="02:15.627" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">「ハレル」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“能够放晴”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ha re ru 」</span></p><p begin="02:16.344" end="02:20.861" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">虹が出る頃には季節も巡り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彩虹出现时 季节也开始轮回</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ji ga de ru ko ro ni ha ki se tsu mo me gu ri</span></p><p begin="02:21.449" end="02:23.681" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">誰も生まれ変われる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁都可以重获新生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re mo u ma re ka wa re ru</span></p><p begin="02:24.284" end="02:29.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">人生とは なんて素晴らしいんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人生是多么美好啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji n se i to ha na n te su ba ra shi i n da</span></p><p begin="02:30.953" end="02:35.639" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">誰かと知り合って 愛し愛され<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与人相识 相亲相爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re ka to shi ri a 't te a i shi a i sa re</span></p><p begin="02:36.233" end="02:38.466" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">気づけば思い出<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回想起来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki du ke ba o mo i de</span></p><p begin="02:39.126" end="02:43.026" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">器用じゃない生き方すら素敵<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">笨拙的生活方式也很棒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki yo u ja na i i ki ka ta su ra su te ki</span></p><p begin="02:44.194" end="02:46.112" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">青い空が ずっとそこに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">蔚蓝天空并非总是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a o i so ra ga zu 't to so ko ni</span></p><p begin="02:46.428" end="02:48.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">あったわけじゃない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直都在那里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a 't ta wa ke ja na i</span></p><p begin="02:49.923" end="02:51.072" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">「ずぶ濡れだっていい」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“浑身湿透也没关系”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 zu bu nu re da 't te i i 」</span></p><p begin="02:51.729" end="02:53.685" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">「君は雨空の下で夢を見るべきだ」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“你应该在落雨的天空下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ki mi ha a ma zo ra no shi ta de</span></p><p begin="02:54.156" end="02:56.891" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">風に吹かれ 雨に打たれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续追梦”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ni fu ka re a me ni u ta re</span></p><p begin="02:57.639" end="03:02.454" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">野ざらしの花は逞しいんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">野花都是很强壮的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">no za ra shi no ha na ha ta ku ma shi i n da</span></p><p begin="03:03.500" end="03:03.683" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">「ハレロ」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“放晴吧”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ha re ro 」</span></p><p begin="03:04.240" end="03:08.855" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">風が吹き始めて 世界は回り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">风开始吹拂 世界在旋转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ga fu ki ha ji me te se ka i ha ma wa ri</span></p><p begin="03:09.512" end="03:11.765" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">空の色も変わる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天空的颜色也改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra no i ro mo ka wa ru</span></p><p begin="03:12.263" end="03:17.699" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">晴天とは なんて美しいんだ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">晴天为何会如此美丽？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se i te n to ha na n te u tsu ku shi i n da ?</span></p><p begin="03:18.970" end="03:23.587" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">時間が過ぎた後は 涙も乾き<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时间流逝后 眼泪也干涸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ki ga su gi ta a to ha na mi da mo ka wa ki</span></p><p begin="03:24.358" end="03:26.475" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">何も残らない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">什么都未曾留下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni mo no ko ra na i</span></p><p begin="03:27.064" end="03:34.998" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">身も心も 晴れ晴れしている未来<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">未来 身心同样晴空万里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi mo ko ko ro mo ha re ba re shi te i ru mi ra i</span></p></div></body></tt>